  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Laman1 and Lemuel murmur in many things, 1 Ne. 2:11 (3:31; 16:20; 2 Ne. 1:26; 5:4). Nephi1 is favored of the Lord because he has not murmured, 1 Ne. 3:6. Lehi1 begins to murmur against the Lord, 1 Ne. 16:20. people of Lehi1 begin to bear journeyings without murmurings, 1 Ne. 17:2. Nephi1 admonishes brethren to murmur no more, 1 Ne. 17:49. they who murmured shall learn doctrine, 2 Ne. 27:35. great murmurings among Lamanites because of Aaron3 and his companions, Alma 22:24.",
